@startuml US_3_2_3_C4_Processos
title US 3.2.3 - Processo de refresh de sessão

actor SPA
participant API as "/authtest/me"

loop on app start / route
  SPA -> API: GET /authtest/me (cookie)
  alt válido
    API --> SPA: profile
    SPA -> SPA: loggedIn$=true
  else expirado
    API --> SPA: 401
    SPA -> SPA: limpar cache; redirect /login
  end
end

SPA -> API: /authtest/logout on user action
API --> SPA: redirect to frontend root

@enduml
